Demo recordings

The three sample readings in App/Sources/Demo/Samples (the opening lines of the
Gettysburg Address and of the Declaration of Independence) are cut from
LibriVox recordings read by Jim Cadwell, which LibriVox places in the public
domain: https://archive.org/details/gettysburg_address4_librivox and
https://archive.org/details/declaration_of_independence_librivox

